# Counter-example: the push was rejected, so stop asking.
#
# `--force` does not check anything. origin/feature/search-ui becomes your
# squashed commit, and the colleague's test is reachable from nothing on the
# remote. They wrote it this morning, in response to your review request, and
# nobody is told.
#
# This is the exact push --force-with-lease refused to make.

git push origin feature/search-ui
git push --force origin feature/search-ui
git log --oneline --decorate --all
ls
